do_2 = "Add test_wheel_metadata_declares_test_extra in sdk/integrations/fastapi/tests/test_build_backend.py: load the real local backend, call build_wheel into two temporary directories, open the resulting archives and parse their METADATA, assert that Provides-Extra includes test and that its conditional requirements match every dependency in pyproject.toml:23 and tests/requirements.txt:1, assert those markers select the dependencies only for the test extra while runtime requirements stay unconditional, and assert the two wheels are byte-identical; retain the declaration check at tests/ci/test_platform_middleware_suites_wired.py:108."
